NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000306 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000307 "Source repository is at L<https://github.com/perlancar/perl-PERLANCAR-Module-List>."
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000308 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000309 "=head1 BUGS"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000310 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000311 "Please report any bugs or feature requests on the bugtracker website L<https://rt.cpan.org/Public/Dist/Display.html?Name=PERLANCAR-Module-List>"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000312 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000313 "When submitting a bug or request, please include a test-file or a"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000314 "patch to an existing test-file that illustrates the bug or desired"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000315 "feature."
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000316 ""
